### mq-proxy REST request examples
### Compatible with JetBrains HTTP Client and VS Code REST Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = cloudtui
@password = changeme
@queue = orders
@messageId = ID:replace-with-actual-id

# ─── Queues ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all queues with stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/management/command/list-queues
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### ─── Messages ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all messages in a queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/management/command/list-messages?sourceQueue={{queue}}
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### List messages filtered by JMS type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/management/command/list-messages?sourceQueue={{queue}}&jmsType=order-created
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### List messages within a date range, capped at 10, without bodies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/management/command/list-messages?sourceQueue={{queue}}&fromDate=2025-01-31T08:30:00Z&toDate=2025-02-01T17:00:00Z&maxCount=10&returnBody=false
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### Send a new message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/management/command/send-message
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetQueue": "{{queue}}",
  "jmsType": "order-created",
  "body": "{\"orderId\":\"12345\",\"status\":\"NEW\",\"amount\":99.95}"
}

### Delete a single message by ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/management/command/delete-messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "sourceQueue": "{{queue}}",
    "filter": { "messageId": "{{messageId}}", "maxCount": 1 }
  }
]

### Delete up to 10 messages of a given JMS type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/management/command/delete-messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "sourceQueue": "{{queue}}",
    "filter": { "jmsType": "order-created", "maxCount": 10 }
  }
]

### Purge all messages from a queue (empty filter matches everything)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/management/command/delete-messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "sourceQueue": "{{queue}}", "filter": {} }
]

### Move a single message to another queue
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/management/command/move-messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "sourceQueue": "{{queue}}",
    "targetQueue": "dlq",
    "filter": { "messageId": "{{messageId}}", "maxCount": 1 }
  }
]

### Move all messages from one queue to another (empty filter matches everything)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/management/command/move-messages
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "sourceQueue": "{{queue}}", "targetQueue": "archive", "filter": {} }
]
